    {
      "name": "full_audit",
      "description": "Audit conversion tracking, wasted spend, structure, keywords, ads and settings. Quick scores three of the 73 checks, month to date; deep attempts all 73 over the `days` window, with a health score. Findings: failures first, then by severity, not impact; some carry a fixing call. Account ids and the business profile come from get_org_context. Read-only.\n\nTools revision: 6145d0b5.",
